  "solution": {
    "text": "A planar carbocation is generated when $\\mathrm{SbCl}_{5}$ remove $\\mathrm{Cl}^{-}$ from the substrate. This carbocation is subsequently attacked by $\\mathrm{Cl}^{-}$ (nucleophile) from both the sides (j.e. from top and bottom) to produce a racemic mixture.",
